          "id": "code-ml-14-1-ch14_1_sklearn",
          "title": "Scikit-Learn: Dekorelasi max_features (1.0 vs 0.33 vs sqrt) & Konvergensi B Tanpa Overfitting",
          "language": "python",
          "filename": "14_1_sklearn_max_features_decorrelation.py",
          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom sklearn.ensemble import RandomForestRegressor\nfrom sklearn.metrics import root_mean_squared_error\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(142)\nn_tr, n_te, d = 600, 400, 18\nX_tr = rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=(n_tr, d))\nX_te = rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=(n_te, d))\n\n# 1 prediktor dominan + 5 interaksi sedang + 12 kolom derau (rezim klasik tempat bagging murni berkorelasi tinggi)\ndef signal(X: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:\n    return (\n        4.0 * X[:, 0]\n        + 1.6 * np.maximum(X[:, 1], 0.0)\n        + 1.4 * X[:, 2] * X[:, 3]\n        - 1.3 * np.sin(1.8 * X[:, 4])\n        + 1.1 * (X[:, 5] ** 2)\n    )\n\ny_tr = signal(X_tr) + rng.normal(0.0, 1.2, size=n_tr)\ny_te = signal(X_te) + rng.normal(0.0, 1.2, size=n_te)\n\nprint(\"=== 1. Efek Dekorelasi max_features (m) pada RandomForestRegressor (B=80) ===\")\nprint(\"Strategi max_features  | Corr Residual (rho) | RMSE 1 Pohon | RMSE Ensemble | Rasio Penurunan\")\nprint(\"-\" * 95)\nfor label, mf in [\n    (\"Bagging Murni (1.0)\", 1.0),\n    (\"Half Features (0.5)\", 0.5),\n    (\"Default Reg (0.33)\", 0.33),\n    (\"Sqrt Features (sqrt)\", \"sqrt\"),\n    (\"Ekstrem (m=1)\", 1),\n]:\n    rf = RandomForestRegressor(\n        n_estimators=80, max_features=mf, min_samples_leaf=2, random_state=42, n_jobs=1\n    ).fit(X_tr, y_tr)\n    # Matriks galat tiap pohon terhadap ground truth pada data uji (B x n_te)\n    tree_preds = np.vstack([est.predict(X_te) for est in rf.estimators_])\n    errs = tree_preds - y_te[None, :]\n    corr_mat = np.corrcoef(errs)\n    B = len(rf.estimators_)\n    mean_rho = float((np.sum(corr_mat) - B) / (B * (B - 1)))\n    single_rmse = float(np.mean([root_mean_squared_error(y_te, p) for p in tree_preds]))\n    ens_rmse = float(root_mean_squared_error(y_te, tree_preds.mean(axis=0)))\n    drop_pct = 100.0 * (single_rmse - ens_rmse) / single_rmse\n    print(f\"{label:22s} | {mean_rho:19.4f} | {single_rmse:12.4f} | {ens_rmse:13.4f} | {drop_pct:14.2f}%\")\n\nprint(\"\\n=== 2. Bukti Tidak Ada Overfitting Klasik Saat B (n_estimators) Naik (max_features=0.33) ===\")\nprint(\"Jumlah Pohon B | RMSE Latih | RMSE Uji | Status Generalisasi\")\nprint(\"-\" * 64)\nrf_full = RandomForestRegressor(\n    n_estimators=160, max_features=0.33, min_samples_leaf=2, random_state=42, n_jobs=1\n).fit(X_tr, y_tr)\ntr_all = np.vstack([est.predict(X_tr) for est in rf_full.estimators_])\nte_all = np.vstack([est.predict(X_te) for est in rf_full.estimators_])\nfor b_cut in [5, 15, 40, 80, 160]:\n    r_tr = float(root_mean_squared_error(y_tr, tr_all[:b_cut].mean(axis=0)))\n    r_te = float(root_mean_squared_error(y_te, te_all[:b_cut].mean(axis=0)))\n    note = \"Varians masih tinggi\" if b_cut <= 15 else (\"Konvergen stabil\" if b_cut >= 80 else \"Menurun tajam\")\n    print(f\"{b_cut:14d} | {r_tr:10.4f} | {r_te:8.4f} | {note}\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== 1. Efek Dekorelasi max_features (m) pada RandomForestRegressor (B=80) ===\nStrategi max_features  | Corr Residual (rho) | RMSE 1 Pohon | RMSE Ensemble | Rasio Penurunan\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nBagging Murni (1.0)    |              0.4454 |       3.2743 |        2.1991 |          32.84%\nHalf Features (0.5)    |              0.3847 |       3.5665 |        2.2246 |          37.63%\nDefault Reg (0.33)     |              0.3488 |       4.0266 |        2.3932 |          40.57%\nSqrt Features (sqrt)   |              0.3483 |       4.2050 |        2.5030 |          40.48%\nEkstrem (m=1)          |              0.4447 |       5.4046 |        3.6559 |          32.36%\n\n=== 2. Bukti Tidak Ada Overfitting Klasik Saat B (n_estimators) Naik (max_features=0.33) ===\nJumlah Pohon B | RMSE Latih | RMSE Uji | Status Generalisasi\n----------------------------------------------------------------\n             5 |     1.6192 |   2.8799 | Varians masih tinggi\n            15 |     1.2758 |   2.4794 | Varians masih tinggi\n            40 |     1.2252 |   2.4359 | Menurun tajam\n            80 |     1.1858 |   2.3932 | Konvergen stabil\n           160 |     1.1589 |   2.3827 | Konvergen stabil",
          "actualOutput": "=== 1. Efek Dekorelasi max_features (m) pada RandomForestRegressor (B=80) ===\nStrategi max_features  | Corr Residual (rho) | RMSE 1 Pohon | RMSE Ensemble | Rasio Penurunan\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nBagging Murni (1.0)    |              0.4454 |       3.2743 |        2.1991 |          32.84%\nHalf Features (0.5)    |              0.3847 |       3.5665 |        2.2246 |          37.63%\nDefault Reg (0.33)     |              0.3488 |       4.0266 |        2.3932 |          40.57%\nSqrt Features (sqrt)   |              0.3483 |       4.2050 |        2.5030 |          40.48%\nEkstrem (m=1)          |              0.4447 |       5.4046 |        3.6559 |          32.36%\n\n=== 2. Bukti Tidak Ada Overfitting Klasik Saat B (n_estimators) Naik (max_features=0.33) ===\nJumlah Pohon B | RMSE Latih | RMSE Uji | Status Generalisasi\n----------------------------------------------------------------\n             5 |     1.6192 |   2.8799 | Varians masih tinggi\n            15 |     1.2758 |   2.4794 | Varians masih tinggi\n            40 |     1.2252 |   2.4359 | Menurun tajam\n            80 |     1.1858 |   2.3932 | Konvergen stabil\n           160 |     1.1589 |   2.3827 | Konvergen stabil",
