          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom sklearn.ensemble import RandomForestRegressor\nfrom sklearn.linear_model import Ridge\nfrom sklearn.metrics import root_mean_squared_error\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(143)\n\n# Audit 1: Blindness Ekstrapolasi RF pada Tren Monotonik (Convex Hull Trap)\nx_tr = rng.uniform(0.0, 10.0, size=(300, 1))\ny_tr = 3.5 * x_tr[:, 0] + 4.0 * np.sin(x_tr[:, 0]) + rng.normal(0.0, 1.5, size=300)\n\nx_in = rng.uniform(0.5, 9.5, size=(150, 1))\ny_in = 3.5 * x_in[:, 0] + 4.0 * np.sin(x_in[:, 0])\nx_out = rng.uniform(10.5, 16.0, size=(150, 1))\ny_out = 3.5 * x_out[:, 0] + 4.0 * np.sin(x_out[:, 0])\n\nrf_tr = RandomForestRegressor(n_estimators=100, min_samples_leaf=3, random_state=42, n_jobs=1).fit(x_tr, y_tr)\nridge_tr = Ridge(alpha=1.0).fit(x_tr, y_tr)\n\npred_rf_out = rf_tr.predict(x_out)\nprint(\"=== Audit 1: Kegagalan Ekstrapolasi Random Forest di Luar Rentang Latih [0, 10] ===\")\nprint(f\"Rentang y_train asli       : [{y_tr.min():.2f}, {y_tr.max():.2f}]\")\nprint(f\"Rentang prediksi RF [10-16]: [{pred_rf_out.min():.2f}, {pred_rf_out.max():.2f}] (MENTOK di plafon daun!)\")\nprint(f\"Rentang y_true uji [10-16] : [{y_out.min():.2f}, {y_out.max():.2f}]\")\nprint(f\"RMSE In-Domain  [0.5..9.5] : RF = {root_mean_squared_error(y_in, rf_tr.predict(x_in)):.3f} vs Ridge = {root_mean_squared_error(y_in, ridge_tr.predict(x_in)):.3f}\")\nprint(f\"RMSE Ekstrapol  [10.5..16] : RF = {root_mean_squared_error(y_out, pred_rf_out):.3f} vs Ridge = {root_mean_squared_error(y_out, ridge_tr.predict(x_out)):.3f}\")\n\n# Audit 2: Ledakan Node & Memori Serving pada min_samples_leaf=1 vs Terbatas\nX_m = rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=(900, 10))\ny_m = 2.0 * X_m[:, 0] - 1.5 * X_m[:, 1] ** 2 + X_m[:, 2] * X_m[:, 3] + rng.normal(0.0, 1.8, size=900)\nX_m_te = rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=(400, 10))\ny_m_te = 2.0 * X_m_te[:, 0] - 1.5 * X_m_te[:, 1] ** 2 + X_m_te[:, 2] * X_m_te[:, 3] + rng.normal(0.0, 1.8, size=400)\n\nprint(\"\\n=== Audit 2: Jejak Memori Node (Serving RAM) vs Akurasi (B=100, N=900) ===\")\nprint(\"min_samples_leaf | Total Node | Estimasi RAM (KB) | RMSE Uji | Penghematan Node\")\nprint(\"-\" * 80)\nbase_nodes = None\nfor msl in [1, 3, 5, 10, 20]:\n    m = RandomForestRegressor(\n        n_estimators=100, max_features=0.4, min_samples_leaf=msl, random_state=42, n_jobs=1\n    ).fit(X_m, y_m)\n    tot_nodes = int(sum(e.tree_.node_count for e in m.estimators_))\n    if base_nodes is None:\n        base_nodes = tot_nodes\n    # Setiap node Scikit-Learn Tree struct ~64 byte (left, right, feature, threshold, impurity, n_samples, value)\n    est_kb = (tot_nodes * 64) / 1024.0\n    rmse = float(root_mean_squared_error(y_m_te, m.predict(X_m_te)))\n    saved_pct = 100.0 * (1.0 - tot_nodes / base_nodes)\n    print(f\"{msl:16d} | {tot_nodes:10d} | {est_kb:17.1f} | {rmse:8.4f} | {saved_pct:15.1f}%\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== Audit 1: Kegagalan Ekstrapolasi Random Forest di Luar Rentang Latih [0, 10] ===\nRentang y_train asli       : [-0.08, 36.36]\nRentang prediksi RF [10-16]: [33.37, 33.37] (MENTOK di plafon daun!)\nRentang y_true uji [10-16] : [33.27, 55.15]\nRMSE In-Domain  [0.5..9.5] : RF = 0.548 vs Ridge = 2.965\nRMSE Ekstrapol  [10.5..16] : RF = 15.468 vs Ridge = 2.919\n\n=== Audit 2: Jejak Memori Node (Serving RAM) vs Akurasi (B=100, N=900) ===\nmin_samples_leaf | Total Node | Estimasi RAM (KB) | RMSE Uji | Penghematan Node\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n               1 |     113610 |            7100.6 |   2.2208 |             0.0%\n               3 |      31542 |            1971.4 |   2.2412 |            72.2%\n               5 |      18256 |            1141.0 |   2.2669 |            83.9%\n              10 |       8908 |             556.8 |   2.3403 |            92.2%\n              20 |       4322 |             270.1 |   2.4225 |            96.2%",
