          "filename": "14_2_sklearn_rf_vs_extratrees_benchmark.py",
          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom sklearn.ensemble import ExtraTreesRegressor, RandomForestRegressor\nfrom sklearn.metrics import r2_score, root_mean_squared_error\nfrom sklearn.model_selection import KFold, cross_val_score\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(145)\n\ndef make_dataset(n: int, n_noise: int, seed: int):\n    r = np.random.default_rng(seed)\n    X_sig = r.uniform(-2.0, 2.0, size=(n, 5))\n    y = (\n        2.5 * np.sin(X_sig[:, 0])\n        + 1.8 * X_sig[:, 1] * X_sig[:, 2]\n        - 1.2 * (X_sig[:, 3] ** 2)\n        + 1.5 * X_sig[:, 4]\n        + r.normal(0.0, 0.7, size=n)\n    )\n    X_noise = r.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=(n, n_noise))\n    return np.hstack([X_sig, X_noise]), y\n\nprint(\"=== Perbandingan RandomForest vs ExtraTrees pada Rezim Signal Halus vs Noise Tinggi ===\")\nprint(\"Rezim & Model                         | R2 OOB | R2 5-CV | RMSE Uji | Corr (rho) | Total Node\")\nprint(\"-\" * 96)\n\nfor regime, n_noise in [(\"A. Sinyal Halus (5 sig + 3 noise)\", 3), (\"B. Noise Tinggi (5 sig + 35 noise)\", 35)]:\n    X_tr, y_tr = make_dataset(420, n_noise, seed=10 + n_noise)\n    X_te, y_te = make_dataset(300, n_noise, seed=99 + n_noise)\n    cv = KFold(n_splits=5, shuffle=True, random_state=42)\n\n    models = [\n        (\"RF (bootstrap=True, OOB)\", RandomForestRegressor(n_estimators=60, max_features=0.5, min_samples_leaf=2, oob_score=True, random_state=42, n_jobs=1)),\n        (\"ET (bootstrap=False, Geurts)\", ExtraTreesRegressor(n_estimators=60, max_features=0.5, min_samples_leaf=2, bootstrap=False, random_state=42, n_jobs=1)),\n        (\"ET (bootstrap=True, OOB)\", ExtraTreesRegressor(n_estimators=60, max_features=0.5, min_samples_leaf=2, bootstrap=True, oob_score=True, random_state=42, n_jobs=1)),\n    ]\n    for m_name, mdl in models:\n        mdl.fit(X_tr, y_tr)\n        oob_str = f\"{mdl.oob_score_:6.3f}\" if getattr(mdl, \"oob_score\", False) else \"  N/A \"\n        cv_r2 = float(np.mean(cross_val_score(mdl, X_tr, y_tr, cv=cv, scoring=\"r2\", n_jobs=1)))\n        preds_mat = np.vstack([e.predict(X_te) for e in mdl.estimators_])\n        rmse_te = float(root_mean_squared_error(y_te, preds_mat.mean(axis=0)))\n        errs = preds_mat - y_te[None, :]\n        cmat = np.corrcoef(errs)\n        B = len(mdl.estimators_)\n        rho = float((np.sum(cmat) - B) / (B * (B - 1)))\n        nodes = int(sum(e.tree_.node_count for e in mdl.estimators_))\n        tag = f\"{regime[:10]} | {m_name}\"\n        print(f\"{tag:37s} | {oob_str} | {cv_r2:7.3f} | {rmse_te:8.4f} | {rho:10.4f} | {nodes:10d}\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== Perbandingan RandomForest vs ExtraTrees pada Rezim Signal Halus vs Noise Tinggi ===\nRezim & Model                         | R2 OOB | R2 5-CV | RMSE Uji | Corr (rho) | Total Node\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nA. Sinyal  | RF (bootstrap=True, OOB) |  0.587 |   0.589 |   2.4932 |     0.4667 |      13726\nA. Sinyal  | ET (bootstrap=False, Geurts) |   N/A  |   0.624 |   2.3059 |     0.4668 |      20398\nA. Sinyal  | ET (bootstrap=True, OOB) |  0.629 |   0.587 |   2.4133 |     0.4699 |      12808\nB. Noise T | RF (bootstrap=True, OOB) |  0.523 |   0.532 |   2.8188 |     0.4778 |      13742\nB. Noise T | ET (bootstrap=False, Geurts) |   N/A  |   0.529 |   2.6802 |     0.4243 |      21698\nB. Noise T | ET (bootstrap=True, OOB) |  0.489 |   0.485 |   2.7558 |     0.4235 |      13644",
          "actualOutput": "=== Perbandingan RandomForest vs ExtraTrees pada Rezim Signal Halus vs Noise Tinggi ===\nRezim & Model                         | R2 OOB | R2 5-CV | RMSE Uji | Corr (rho) | Total Node\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nA. Sinyal  | RF (bootstrap=True, OOB) |  0.587 |   0.589 |   2.4932 |     0.4667 |      13726\nA. Sinyal  | ET (bootstrap=False, Geurts) |   N/A  |   0.624 |   2.3059 |     0.4668 |      20398\nA. Sinyal  | ET (bootstrap=True, OOB) |  0.629 |   0.587 |   2.4133 |     0.4699 |      12808\nB. Noise T | RF (bootstrap=True, OOB) |  0.523 |   0.532 |   2.8188 |     0.4778 |      13742\nB. Noise T | ET (bootstrap=False, Geurts) |   N/A  |   0.529 |   2.6802 |     0.4243 |      21698\nB. Noise T | ET (bootstrap=True, OOB) |  0.489 |   0.485 |   2.7558 |     0.4235 |      13644",
          "explanation": "Membandingkan RandomForest(oob_score=True) melawan ExtraTrees(bootstrap=False/True) pada rezim sinyal halus vs noise tinggi dalam hal R2 OOB, R2 5-Fold CV, RMSE uji, korelasi residual rho, dan total jumlah simpul.",
