          "id": "code-ml-14-2-ch14_2_diag",
          "title": "Audit Produksi: 4 Skenario Kebocoran OOB (i.i.d. Sah vs Grouped vs Time-Series vs Pre-Target-Encoding)",
          "language": "python",
          "filename": "14_2_oob_leakage_four_traps_audit.py",
          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom sklearn.ensemble import RandomForestRegressor\nfrom sklearn.metrics import r2_score\nfrom sklearn.model_selection import GroupKFold, TimeSeriesSplit\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(146)\n\nprint(\"=== Audit 4 Skenario OOB: Kapan OOB Jujur vs Kapan OOB Bocor Parah ===\")\nprint(\"Skenario Data / Pipeline                   | OOB R2 (Ilusi) | Validasi Benar R2 | Celah Bocor\")\nprint(\"-\" * 96)\n\n# 1. Skenario SAH: Data Cross-Sectional i.i.d. Murni\nX_iid = rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=(600, 6))\ny_iid = 2.0 * X_iid[:, 0] - 1.5 * X_iid[:, 1] ** 2 + X_iid[:, 2] * X_iid[:, 3] + rng.normal(0.0, 0.8, 600)\nX_iid_te = rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=(300, 6))\ny_iid_te = 2.0 * X_iid_te[:, 0] - 1.5 * X_iid_te[:, 1] ** 2 + X_iid_te[:, 2] * X_iid_te[:, 3] + rng.normal(0.0, 0.8, 300)\nrf1 = RandomForestRegressor(n_estimators=100, oob_score=True, random_state=42, n_jobs=1).fit(X_iid, y_iid)\nr2_true_1 = float(r2_score(y_iid_te, rf1.predict(X_iid_te)))\nprint(f\"{'1. Cross-Sectional i.i.d. Murni (SAH)':42s} | {rf1.oob_score_:14.4f} | {r2_true_1:17.4f} | {rf1.oob_score_ - r2_true_1:+11.4f}\")\n\n# 2. Skenario BOCOR 1: Data Grouped Entity (100 nasabah x 6 snapshot bulanan dengan efek laten nasabah)\nn_users, snaps = 100, 6\ngroups = np.repeat(np.arange(n_users), snaps)\nuser_profile = rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=(n_users, 4))\nuser_latent_risk = rng.normal(0.0, 3.0, size=n_users)  # efek unik per nasabah yang tidak terukur\nX_grp = np.repeat(user_profile, snaps, axis=0) + rng.normal(0.0, 0.08, size=(n_users * snaps, 4))\nX_grp = np.column_stack([X_grp, rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=(n_users * snaps, 2))])\ny_grp = 1.0 * X_grp[:, 0] + np.repeat(user_latent_risk, snaps) + rng.normal(0.0, 0.5, size=n_users * snaps)\n\nrf2 = RandomForestRegressor(n_estimators=100, oob_score=True, random_state=42, n_jobs=1).fit(X_grp, y_grp)\ngkf = GroupKFold(n_splits=5)\ngrp_scores = []\nfor tr_i, va_i in gkf.split(X_grp, y_grp, groups):\n    m = RandomForestRegressor(n_estimators=100, random_state=42, n_jobs=1).fit(X_grp[tr_i], y_grp[tr_i])\n    grp_scores.append(float(r2_score(y_grp[va_i], m.predict(X_grp[va_i]))))\nr2_true_2 = float(np.mean(grp_scores))\nprint(f\"{'2. Grouped Entity (6x/nasabah) -> BOCOR!':42s} | {rf2.oob_score_:14.4f} | {r2_true_2:17.4f} | {rf2.oob_score_ - r2_true_2:+11.4f}\")\n\n# 3. Skenario BOCOR 2: Deret Waktu Autokorelasi AR(1) / Random Walk dengan Tren\nT = 600\nt_idx = np.arange(T)\nstate = np.cumsum(rng.normal(0.0, 0.35, size=T))  # proses stokastik persisten\nX_ts = np.column_stack([t_idx / T, np.sin(2 * np.pi * t_idx / 40), rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=(T, 3))])\ny_ts = state + 0.8 * np.sin(2 * np.pi * t_idx / 40) + rng.normal(0.0, 0.25, size=T)\n\nrf3 = RandomForestRegressor(n_estimators=100, oob_score=True, random_state=42, n_jobs=1).fit(X_ts, y_ts)\ntscv = TimeSeriesSplit(n_splits=4)\nts_scores = []\nfor tr_i, va_i in tscv.split(X_ts):\n    m = RandomForestRegressor(n_estimators=100, random_state=42, n_jobs=1).fit(X_ts[tr_i], y_ts[tr_i])\n    ts_scores.append(float(r2_score(y_ts[va_i], m.predict(X_ts[va_i]))))\nr2_true_3 = float(np.mean(ts_scores))\nprint(f\"{'3. Time-Series AR(1) / Drift -> BOCOR!':42s} | {rf3.oob_score_:14.4f} | {r2_true_3:17.4f} | {rf3.oob_score_ - r2_true_3:+11.4f}\")\n\n# 4. Skenario BOCOR 3: Global Target Encoding (High-Cardinality Noise ID) Sebelum OOB\nn_te_sz = 600\ncat_id = rng.integers(0, 180, size=n_te_sz)  # ID acak tanpa sinyal sejati\nX_base = rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=(n_te_sz, 3))\ny_te_s = 1.2 * X_base[:, 0] + rng.normal(0.0, 1.5, size=n_te_sz)\n# ANTI-PATTERN: hitung rata-rata target per cat_id pada SELURUH data sebelum masuk RF(oob_score=True)!\ncat_means = {c: float(np.mean(y_te_s[cat_id == c])) for c in np.unique(cat_id)}\nte_leaky = np.array([cat_means[c] for c in cat_id])\nX_leaky = np.column_stack([X_base, te_leaky])\nrf4_leaky = RandomForestRegressor(n_estimators=100, oob_score=True, random_state=42, n_jobs=1).fit(X_leaky, y_te_s)\n# Validasi jujur (split 70/30 dengan target encoding hanya di-fit di train)\nsplit = 420\ntr_means = {c: float(np.mean(y_te_s[:split][cat_id[:split] == c])) for c in np.unique(cat_id[:split])}\nglobal_m = float(np.mean(y_te_s[:split]))\nX_tr_clean = np.column_stack([X_base[:split], [tr_means[c] for c in cat_id[:split]]])\nX_va_clean = np.column_stack([X_base[split:], [tr_means.get(c, global_m) for c in cat_id[split:]]])\nrf4_clean = RandomForestRegressor(n_estimators=100, random_state=42, n_jobs=1).fit(X_tr_clean, y_te_s[:split])\nr2_true_4 = float(r2_score(y_te_s[split:], rf4_clean.predict(X_va_clean)))\nprint(f\"{'4. Pre-Fit Target Encoding + OOB -> BOCOR!':42s} | {rf4_leaky.oob_score_:14.4f} | {r2_true_4:17.4f} | {rf4_leaky.oob_score_ - r2_true_4:+11.4f}\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== Audit 4 Skenario OOB: Kapan OOB Jujur vs Kapan OOB Bocor Parah ===\nSkenario Data / Pipeline                   | OOB R2 (Ilusi) | Validasi Benar R2 | Celah Bocor\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n1. Cross-Sectional i.i.d. Murni (SAH)      |         0.7976 |            0.7672 |     +0.0304\n2. Grouped Entity (6x/nasabah) -> BOCOR!   |         0.7287 |           -0.5660 |     +1.2948\n3. Time-Series AR(1) / Drift -> BOCOR!     |         0.9753 |           -2.5909 |     +3.5663\n4. Pre-Fit Target Encoding + OOB -> BOCOR! |         0.3869 |           -0.1185 |     +0.5054",
          "actualOutput": "=== Audit 4 Skenario OOB: Kapan OOB Jujur vs Kapan OOB Bocor Parah ===\nSkenario Data / Pipeline                   | OOB R2 (Ilusi) | Validasi Benar R2 | Celah Bocor\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n1. Cross-Sectional i.i.d. Murni (SAH)      |         0.7976 |            0.7672 |     +0.0304\n2. Grouped Entity (6x/nasabah) -> BOCOR!   |         0.7287 |           -0.5660 |     +1.2948\n3. Time-Series AR(1) / Drift -> BOCOR!     |         0.9753 |           -2.5909 |     +3.5663\n4. Pre-Fit Target Encoding + OOB -> BOCOR! |         0.3869 |           -0.1185 |     +0.5054",
          "explanation": "Mengukur secara kuantitatif keselarasan OOB pada data i.i.d. murni berbanding terbalik dengan celah ilusi bocor OOB yang kolosal pada data grouped entity, deret waktu AR(1), dan global target encoding pra-pelatihan.",
