          "starterCode": "import numpy as np\n\ndef compute_oob_mse_and_coverage(y_true, boot_indices_list, tree_preds_full) -> tuple[float, float, float]:\n    y = np.asarray(y_true, dtype=float)\n    preds = np.asarray(tree_preds_full, dtype=float)\n    B, n = preds.shape\n    # TODO: akumulasi prediksi hanya pada mask ~in_bag per pohon, hitung coverage_ratio, avg_oob_trees, oob_mse\n    pass\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(19)\nn_s, B_s = 30, 12\ny_s = rng.normal(10.0, 2.0, size=n_s)\nboots_s = [rng.integers(0, n_s, size=n_s) for _ in range(B_s)]\npreds_s = y_s[None, :] + rng.normal(0.0, 0.9, size=(B_s, n_s))\nprint(compute_oob_mse_and_coverage(y_s, boots_s, preds_s))",
