          "solution": "```python\nimport numpy as np\n\ndef heldout_permutation_r2(weights, X_val, y_val, n_repeats: int = 10, seed: int = 42) -> tuple[float, list[float]]:\n    w = np.asarray(weights, dtype=float)\n    X = np.asarray(X_val, dtype=float)\n    y = np.asarray(y_val, dtype=float)\n    rng = np.random.default_rng(seed)\n    ss_tot = float(np.sum((y - np.mean(y)) ** 2))\n    base_r2 = 1.0 - float(np.sum((y - X @ w) ** 2)) / ss_tot\n    means = []\n    for j in range(X.shape[1]):\n        drops = []\n        Xp = X.copy()\n        for _ in range(n_repeats):\n            Xp[:, j] = X[rng.permutation(len(y)), j]\n            r2_p = 1.0 - float(np.sum((y - Xp @ w) ** 2)) / ss_tot\n            drops.append(base_r2 - r2_p)\n        means.append(round(float(np.mean(drops)), 4))\n    return (round(base_r2, 4), means)\n```"
